    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a former special forces soldier Finn Ridley, having lost his life and placed in a simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >against his will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He will have to overcome terrible obstacles, in order to obtain eternal rest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main mechanic of War Flavor is time, that is to say that in addition to being timed, it acts as a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >resource for your various abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No life counter is present therefore the number of player lives is relative to the remaining time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In conclusion, the way the player uses his time permanently modifies these game options</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First of all before tackling the case of the bestiary. It should be known that the capacities of the enemies evolve according to the player, of this fact I will treat only the families of monsters in initial form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic mode, this game mode has a story that can vary depending on the actions of the player,the goal is to finish the dierent levels in order to obtain the coveted ice cream.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge mode, the player must complete all 9 levels in a row with an imposed challenge, in case of failure, the player will have to start all over again.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mode, the player must stay alive as long as possible against waves of increasingly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >powerful and numerous enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a former special forces soldier Finn Ridley, having lost his life and placed in a simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >against his will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He will have to overcome terrible obstacles, in order to obtain eternal rest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main mechanic of War Flavor is time, that is to say that in addition to being timed, it acts as a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >resource for your various abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No life counter is present therefore the number of player lives is relative to the remaining time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In conclusion, the way the player uses his time permanently modifies these game options</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First of all before tackling the case of the bestiary. It should be known that the capacities of the enemies evolve according to the player, of this fact I will treat only the families of monsters in initial form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic mode, this game mode has a story that can vary depending on the actions of the player,the goal is to finish the dierent levels in order to obtain the coveted ice cream.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge mode, the player must complete all 9 levels in a row with an imposed challenge, in case of failure, the player will have to start all over again.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mode, the player must stay alive as long as possible against waves of increasingly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >powerful and numerous enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
